---
title: Chocolate Hazelnut Flapjacks
servings: 8
author: Jonathan Simmonds
---

Preheat the #oven to 160°C and line a #20cm square tin{} with baking paper.

Melt @butter{70%g}, @brown sugar{20%g}, @nutella{20%g}, @dark chocolate{40%g} and @golden syrup{40%g} together in a #saucepan over low heat, stirring occasionally, until the butter has melted and the sugar has dissolved.

Take off the heat and stir in @oats{150%g}, @chopped hazelnuts{20%g} and @dried fruit{40%g} until fully coated and combined.

Tip the mixture into the lined tin and press down firmly and evenly with the back of a spoon.

Bake for ~bake{20%minutes}, until golden at the edges. Leave to cool in the tin for ~{10%minutes}.
